      "value": "It seems like they changed the timing in order to fix the jitter while rotating diagonally, which broke timings on some other things. \n\nFor example im using GetTrackingData() in PostLateUpdate() to attach a transform to a hand and its also very jittery now, it used to be perfectly smooth on desktop.",
