  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Be in Desktop mode\n\n2. Find a pickup object that has Auto-Hold enabled or Spawn a prop.\n\n3. Move mouse around\n\nPickups that require a constant grab/hold input are seemingly unaffected\n\nIf you Use an Auto-Hold pickup the jittering stops",
